('Meera Joshi',        5, 'Rajeshwari ji and Veena ji — you both are truly gifted. The food reminded me of my nani''s kitchen in Jaipur. Khana khake aankh bhar aayi. Shukriya aapka! 🙏',                     null,               true, now() - interval '5 days 6 hours'),
