('Rakesh Yadav',       5, 'Maine apni mummy ko yahan ka khana khilaya aur woh bolein ki inhe personally milna chahiye. Itna achha khana hai ki words mein describe karna mushkil hai!',                       null,               true, now() - interval '15 days 2 hours'),
('Shweta Pandey',      5, 'Ordered twice in the same week — that tells you everything you need to know! The matar paneer and jeera rice combo was absolutely perfect. Fresh, hot, and delicious.',             'Matar Paneer',     true, now() - interval '16 days 7 hours'),
('Gaurav Agarwal',     5, 'Best home-cooked food delivery in the city, hands down. The chana masala was rich, tangy and had that slow-cooked depth of flavour you just can''t get from restaurants.',          'Chana Masala',     true, now() - interval '17 days 12 hours'),
('Divya Kapoor',       5, 'I am so glad I found this! The food is soul-warming and made with such love. You can genuinely taste the care that goes into every dish. My family loved the kheer!',              'Kheer',            true, now() - interval '19 days 3 hours'),
