('Kunal Shah',         5, 'The food quality is consistently excellent. I have ordered maybe 8-10 times and each time it is like eating freshly cooked home food. The aloo gobi today was spectacular.',       'Aloo Gobi',        true, now() - interval '28 days 5 hours'),
