('Nitin Jain',         5, 'I specifically sought out authentic Rajasthani food and found this gem. The dal baati churma was prepared traditionally and tasted exactly as it should. Pure bliss!',              'Dal Baati Churma', true, now() - interval '31 days 7 hours'),
