('Sumit Agarwal',      5, 'Itna pyaar se banaya hua khana bohot kam milta hai. Rajeshwari ji ne special note ke saath bheja ki kadhi ko thoda warm karke khao — that personal care makes all the difference!', 'Kadhi',            true, now() - interval '35 days 3 hours'),
('Ritu Choudhary',     5, 'Ordered a get-together spread for 30 people and everyone was asking where I got the food from. The moong dal halwa was the star of the evening. Absolutely unforgettable!',       'Moong Dal Halwa',  true, now() - interval '36 days 9 hours'),
('Varun Kapoor',       5, 'The paneer tikka was juicy, well-marinated and perfectly spiced. Even better than what I get at fancy restaurants, and delivered right to my door. Amazing value!',               'Paneer Tikka',     true, now() - interval '38 days 6 hours'),
('Nidhi Verma',        5, 'Been ordering every Sunday for the past 2 months. My Sunday feels incomplete without Saas Bahu Ki Rasoi''s khana. The consistency in taste and quality is remarkable!',           null,               true, now() - interval '40 days 11 hours'),
('Ajay Sharma',        5, 'The bessan gatte ki sabzi was made exactly the way it is done in Rajasthan — not the watered-down version you get elsewhere. Authentic and absolutely delicious!',                'Gatte Ki Sabzi',   true, now() - interval '41 days 4 hours'),
('Preeti Bansal',      5, 'Ek word mein boluun — LOVE! The food is made with so much heart. The baingan bharta had that proper smoky flavour from roasting. My husband had two helpings!',                   'Baingan Bharta',   true, now() - interval '43 days 14 hours'),
('Mohit Gupta',        5, 'I tried this on a friend''s recommendation and I am so grateful! The saag paneer was rich, creamy and paired beautifully with the soft makki ki roti. Will return!',              'Saag Paneer',      true, now() - interval '44 days 7 hours'),
('Geeta Sharma',       5, 'My mother-in-law visited and I was worried about impressing her with food. Ordered from here and she was so happy she asked for the number to order herself next time! 😊',        null,               true, now() - interval '46 days 5 hours'),
('Sandeep Mathur',     5, 'The mixed dal tadka had perfect balance of spices — not too hot, not too mild. Combined with the ghee-laden baati, it was a heavenly meal. Pure Rajasthani soul food!',           'Dal Tadka',        true, now() - interval '47 days 10 hours'),
('Ishaan Khanna',      5, 'Yaar kya khana hai! The aloo paratha was thick, stuffed generously, and tasted like mom made it. The homemade butter on top was the perfect finishing touch.',                   'Aloo Paratha',     true, now() - interval '49 days 2 hours'),
('Monika Tiwari',      5, 'Every bite feels like a warm hug. The food is prepared with such love and skill. The shahi paneer was rich and creamy — restaurant quality at home price. 5 stars easily!',      'Shahi Paneer',     true, now() - interval '50 days 8 hours'),
('Tarun Rajput',       5, 'Ordered kheer for a pooja at home and Veena ji made sure it had the right sweetness and garnish. She even asked about the occasion! That kind of personal service is priceless.',  'Kheer',            true, now() - interval '52 days 6 hours'),
('Varsha Goyal',       5, 'Three generations of my family ate together — my dadi, my parents, me and my kids — and every one of them loved the food. That is the true test of authentic taste!',             null,               true, now() - interval '53 days 12 hours'),
