('Sunaina Rastogi',    5, 'Maine sabse pehle dal makhani try ki aur ab koi bhi restaurant ka dal makhani achi nahi lagti! Addiction lag gayi hai is khane ki. Thank you so much! 😍',                        'Dal Makhani',      true, now() - interval '56 days 9 hours'),
('Kiran Malhotra',     5, 'The food arrived beautifully packed and still warm. The aloo tamatar ki sabzi and fresh rotis — it was just like Sunday lunch at my aunt''s place in Lucknow. Perfection!',       'Aloo Tamatar',     true, now() - interval '58 days 5 hours'),
('Praveen Dubey',      5, 'Tried the Rajasthani special thali for the first time and I cannot imagine eating anything else this weekend. Everything from the ker sangri to the churma was flawless!',          null,               true, now() - interval '60 days 11 hours'),
('Leena Agarwal',      5, 'My husband usually complains about home delivery food being too oily or too bland. He ate three rotis and asked me to order double next time! Best feedback I could share! 😄',    null,               true, now() - interval '62 days 7 hours'),
