('Suresh Agarwal',     5, 'Main ek chef hoon aur main keh sakta hoon ki is khane mein asli technique aur love dono hain. The masalas are ground fresh, you can tell. Outstanding quality, no shortcuts.',   null,               true, now() - interval '68 days 6 hours'),
('Bhavna Chauhan',     5, 'Placed my order at 11 AM and food arrived perfectly on time. Hot, fresh, beautifully packed. The stuffed mirchi and baati combo was out of this world. Absolutely loved it!',     'Dal Baati Churma', true, now() - interval '70 days 9 hours'),
